title: "Mapping literature discourse: analysis code for Governing with Artificial Intelligence"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis pipeline for the cognitive mapping of AI urbanism:
  corpus assembly from RIS exports, hybrid semantic classification, ordination
  (PCA / NMDS / GNMDS), PERMANOVA, and the paper's Figures 2-6.
